// ZE_SYNDICATE_DOORSPAWN_MEGALITH_INACTIVE :
"P576612817" "You Shouldn't Be Seeing This Text."

// ZE_SYNDICATE_DOORSPAWN_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P1104431662" "The Syndicate does not answer to the self-proclaimed Emperor."

// ZE_SYNDICATE_MEGALITH_INACTIVE :
"P3956490428" "We just have to buy time for Tub Ci to get away."

// ZE_SYNDICATE_MEGALITH_ALERTED :
"P3072852304" "Get'm!"

// ZE_SYNDICATE_LIEUTENANT_MEGALITH_INTERIOR_INACTIVE :
"P2176316589" "I am Tub Ci's trusted advisor."

// ZE_SYNDICATE_LIEUTENANT_MEGALITH_INTERIOR_ALERTED :
"P3259567901" "I advise you to run, fool!"


// ZE_SYNDICATE_BOSS_ROOFTOP_BATTLE_ALERTED :
"P389699616" "Clever of you to have found me, but now you will die!"

// ZE_SYNDICATE_LIEUTENANT_JENNA_MEGALITH_INTERIOR_INACTIVE :
"P3621177794" "Keep an eye out for those blasted capes."

// ZE_SYNDICATE_LIEUTENANT_JENNA_MEGALITH_INTERIOR_ALERTED :
"P2157968183" "There's one!  Do not fail me."

// ZE_SYNDICATE_LIEUTENANT_JESS_MEGALITH_INTERIOR_INACTIVE :
"P2280732318" "Is that kerosene I smell?"

// ZE_SYNDICATE_LIEUTENANT_JESS_MEGALITH_INTERIOR_ALERTED :
"P424603225" "You'll pay for this!"

// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2679860772" "I can read this.  Give me a second."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2099809531" "Wow, this I didn't expect."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P319687631" "Hmmm..."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046391802" "Interesting."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3363245915" "This is what I was worried about."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1680564466" "Well, that explains a lot."

// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2072352987" "Deal with it!"
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3837665452" "Bad move."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1421355091" "You're going down."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1242996919" "Take 'em out."
// IMPERIALCITY_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1452959402" "Clean up this mess."

// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2989402017" "I see the target."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3743855635" "Ah, there you are."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1866421243" "Oh, your minutes are numbered.  Down to single digits now."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3312310146" "Well, hello, there..."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P308460292" "Heh heh heh."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1535865530" "Today is not your lucky day."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1761518271" "Perfect."

// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3393769535" "Bye now."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P448732128" "Well I can't possibly let you leave, now can I?"
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1226330357" "Wow, today is really not a day of luck for you."
// IMPERIALCITY_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1450131637" "No offense but I'm going to have to wipe the floor with you."

// IMPERIALCITY_SEERS_POST_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2357434115" "TODO: Add Text"


// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2603568481" "This isn't going to end well for you!"
// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4106500114" "I'm going to enjoy this"
// UNDERGROUND_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2538582502" "Don't worry. I'll make this quick... though it won't be painless!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P776088764" "Don't worry. Your skills will stay sharp down here. We got Resistance and cops sticking their heads in our business, Destroyers trying to sabotage us and Ghouls trying to eat us. There's no shortage of people looking for a piece of us down here, and that means there's no shortage of practice for us."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1880016108" "It's not so bad really when you realize we're underground. I mean, this is basically a sewer, right? It certainly smells better down here than I ever expected it would."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2479315543" "You would think that getting sent down here meant you've done something wrong. But, what I hear is that you get sent down here when they want to test you. If you're down here, then it means they think you have what it takes to be a big shot, but you're going to have to keep alive and out of jail first."

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P324188338" "We're the Syndicate, fool. You should know better than to mess with us. Now you're in for a world of hurt."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P867668190" "I've been hoping one of you fools would show up. I've been itching for a fight all day!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120857580" "No offense, but you're no match for me."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3576169128" "I'm going to take you down, and there's nothing you can do about it."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_EatDonutBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3494541884" "You can run or you can die. It doesn't matter to me, because either way you're going to lose!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3549428316" "I can't say it's that bad down here. It's pretty quiet, so it's good for meditation. It's also full of people looking to mix it up with us, so I can stay in top fighting condition."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1422224682" "When you're down here, day and night lose all meaning. I wake up when I want, sleep when I want. As long as we keep the operations going smoothly, nothing else really matters when you're down here."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P245132336" "You think these Resistance and cops are a problem? The Destroyers are worse, but even with then, you haven't seen anything yet. It's not until you've fought one of those Ghouls that you'll know what I'm talking about... if you survive, that is."

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4227046807" "You must have a death wish. I'll be happy to oblige you!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3934091410" "It's time for some fun!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2261113944" "Messing with us is going to be the last mistake you ever make."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3500008588" "You think you've got what it takes to beat me? Bring it on."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2943003689" "Fortune does not smile on you today!"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P305202879" "These Ghouls are the worst part about being down here, sure, but you know what I really hate? Feeling like my clothing is wet all the time."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1033017838" "The Emperor's got his hands full dealing with the Resistance. By the time he deals with them, we'll be in position to run everything."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1728420897" "I don't know about you, but I'm hoping one of those fools stumbles over here. I'm looking to test out some new moves I've learned."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2159779279" "I'm the last person you're ever going to mess with."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P745416032" "Your time has run out."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3236826766" "I can see your future, and it doesn't look pretty."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3850355247" "Try not to get your blood on my clothes, OK?"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P3980770275" "Do you fools have any idea where you are going?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P2862685997" "I am to meet with Tub Ci in 30 minutes. Are you certain you cretins will be able to get me there in time?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P4046316361" "Tub Ci waits for no one. If I am late, you will be made to pay the price."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P969163848" "Is this what passes for a member of the Syndicate these days?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P2885623204" "I can see that we shall need to cull the wheat from the chaff within our clan. We grow heavy with useless bodies."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P2646728998" "Why are you taking so long. Do you not know these tunnels?"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P1105565432" "If any of you cretins survive this battle, I will kill you myself."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P1315337994" "Your ignorance has led us to this. I will defeat this intruder and then I'll deal with you."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P1199706083" "It is left to the master to teach his student to fight."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P1963369867" "I shall swat you like the meaningless gnat you are."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P1976401385" "Interference in Syndicate affairs has but one response: death."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_MAPCHECK_VIP_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P2306281150" "Your end comes now!"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2497246297" "Alright. Here's the plan. The Resistance and the cops are going to be duking it out in about an hour. That's when we'll sneak our way into the Resistance vault and help ourselves to some of their hardware."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P247400183" "Look, I'm not sure about this one. There's a lot of Ghouls down in those tunnels."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2504072761" "I just heard that the Destroyers knocked off a police patrol. While they're distracted looting the cops, we'll swoop in, take 'em out and get everyone's stuff."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2734599431" "We've found the informant telling the cops where we've got our caches stored. It's time to take him out."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P3824091112" "Throw me a bone here, alright? It's not a perfect plan, but I'm not hearing any better ideas."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P95647468" "Change of plan. Take out the intruder."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P682045172" "Looks like we have found ourselves a target of opportunity."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P541483263" "I don't know what you heard, but we can't have you running off. Don't worry. We'll make this quick."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P2128961407" "When we're done with you, we can use your body as a diversion for the Ghouls."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P2125329885" "This is just not your day!"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2075028583" "Understood. We'll make sure that we remove the body immediately."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1075888236" "The victim appears to be covered with scratches. We may have interrupted the Ghouls before they started eating."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3437884343" "I can't tell whose weapons made these holes. Could be the Resistance, could be the cops... maybe even one of our own."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3044274715" "Looks like the Destroyers may have gotten the jump on this one. Head's smashed by a brick."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P4290087583" "Something about this just doesn't seem right."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3997468435" "We have a situation. I'll re-establish contact when it's neutralized."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3380656114" "We think we may have a suspect here. Engaging."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3498128295" "Gotta cut this short. Looks like someone wants to tangle with us."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_INVESTIGATION_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P414847571" "Suspicious contact has been sighted. Give us a minute to deal with the problem."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P2368795830" "You call yourselves warriors? The Syndicate expects power, speed and precision! Train harder!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3869862115" "Push yourself, but never lose your center. To give into aggression is to lose the battle!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3869644999" "The key to victory lies not in strength of arms, but strength of mind. Keep your focus!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1776824735" "This is disappointing. I expected better from this crew!"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ACTIVE :
"P588806795" "Consider this a lesson for each of you. How will you engage this threat?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ACTIVE :
"P2204792088" "It appears that you shall all get an opportunity to show me what you have learned!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ACTIVE :
"P2342484728" "If you cannot defeat this fool, you were never good enough for the Syndicate. Attack!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ACTIVE :
"P3639173213" "Consider this your final exam, students. Break that wretch in two!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P713087729" "We're coming in. You'd better have the delivery, or this isn't going to be a good day for you."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P416625438" "Come out now. We promise we'll let you live long enough to tell the boss your side of the story."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P496302528" "I don't think you understand. You either come out here, or we come in. There's no getting out of this one."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P196781695" "Alright, we're going in on 3. Take no prisoners. Leave no one alive."

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P2294697085" "Looks like someone's decided to get involved where they shouldn't. Big mistake."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P2816674684" "We're here for the guy inside, but we got no problem taking you too."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P935439977" "Don't go sticking your nose in other people's business. It's likely to get you killed."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P2679754341" "This is Syndicate business, and we don't like it when people get in our way."

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2323194276" "The Resistance will not stand in our way."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P3835442809" "The Emperor and his minions are weak. You may be able to defeat them. You cannot defeat us."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P4012435565" "Think you can get by us? Think again."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2645365393" "It doesn't matter what you do. In the end, we're going to own it all no matter who rules Praetoria."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P892791840" "The outcome of this war will be no different than the outcome of this battle: even when the Resistance is destroyed, the Syndicate will live!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P3660858571" "Looks like we got ourselves a fight. Take everyone down. We'll sort it out later."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P125300621" "No one escapes. No one."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P1284497201" "Time to break some bones."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P158389289" "This is the last mistake any of you are ever going to make."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_ALERTED :
"P1010258840" "This is going to be fun."

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P206925280" "Not today, Ghouls. Go look somewhere else for food, or it's the last thing you'll do."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2501430057" "Haven't we killed enough of you monsters already?"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P843073754" "These Ghouls are overrunning the tunnels. It's hurting business. Don't let these beasts escape!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_FE_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P3625820662" "I'm going to enjoy destroying these things! Let's get down to business!"


// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_DES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1007110281" "You Destroyers better move on. We'll crush you!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_DES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1495444056" "Still think you're tougher than the Syndicate? When will you wretches learn your place?"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_DES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P872447094" "Keep this up. Go ahead. You're nothing we can't handle."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_DES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2362807038" "You're not going to get out of this alive!"


// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_PPD_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P3490103364" "You cops think you're still king of the hill down here, eh? You have no idea how wrong you are!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_PPD_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P3965120371" "If your Emperor is so mighty, where is he? Will he save your pitiful hide?"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_PPD_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P3131580485" "Your laws mean nothing down here and your luck has run out. Time to face your fate!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYNDICATE_BATTLE_PPD_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2992523535" "Down here, the gloves are off. You cops think you can survive on your own? Let's see."


// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P3999706767" "You Resistance guys have a lot of fight in you, but you haven't won yet! I'm going to enjoy this."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P734733989" "Think this is over? It's not over!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P93853214" "Surrender? Seems like you still have a lot to learn about the Syndicate."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2337158420" "I prefer it when the odds are against me! That makes my inevitable victory all the more satisfying!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P2519154915" "This is it. This is where you meet your end!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P468796155" "It is not your lucky day!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P1450044323" "The time has come to put an end to this."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P3967439538" "I'm not going to lose!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P1563517322" "All of you are going to die."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P1190672085" "I'm going to be walking out of here alive. All of you? You'll be dead!"

// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P4181288867" "Back off! This is your last chance!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P1498498882" "I'm not going to be anything's lunch!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P3026188909" "If I'm going down, I'm taking as many of you with me as I can!"


// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_DES_INACTIVE :
"P1000637684" "Do you have any idea who you're messing with? This isn't over."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_DES_INACTIVE :
"P3058628558" "It may look like you've won, but I assure you, you're going to lose."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_DES_INACTIVE :
"P3077193408" "Leave now and you may yet survive!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_DES_INACTIVE :
"P2189432867" "I feel my fortunes turning. It does not bode well for you!"


// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P2944840052" "When will you cops learn? You may think you've won, but you're mistaken."
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1386662144" "Had enough yet?"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1631356154" "Haven't we done this all before? Haven't you always lost? You still have time to get away!"
// UNDERGROUND_ALLHOODS_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3592151914" "This isn't done. When I'm through with you, you'll wish you'd let me go!"


// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P58293389" "We got our hands on one of the Clockwork. What do you want us to do with it?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P4173713626" "This thing is making me nervous. It could wake up at any moment. When is the extraction team getting here?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1234398494" "People will pay good money for one of these. Get a crew over here now to recover it."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P2628943639" "Leave the robot. We'll get another one. We've got other problems."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3742553814" "Send the team quickly. We've got ourselves a situation here."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P140476112" "We need to hold our position. Some punk is trying to muscle their way into our little transaction."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3037347662" "We found one of Cole's minions snooping around. What do you want us to do with him?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3481142060" "We caught ourselves a cop, sneaking through our turf. Orders?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P608039525" "Yeah, he thought it would be a good idea to mess with us. Now we got him cornered... should we bring him to you?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P4028066520" "This one won't go without a fight. Want us to knock him out?"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P615504204" "We're going to need some support down here."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3112024967" "It looks like we have ourselves a fool looking to rescue the cop."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P903203980" "We've got ourselves a problem."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3635014844" "Someone decided to crash the party. Let us deal with it. We'll get back to you."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P646145255" "We may have an additional captive to return to the club. Send some extra guys with the recovery team."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P3612796320" "If only you knew how much information I've given to the PPD!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P310632112" "The Emperor will find each and every one of you. There's nowhere you can hide!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P3657856594" "You may have caught me, but there's dozens more like me, gathering intelligence on your organization. You'll never stop it!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P1494644107" "You think I'm scared of you? There's nothing you can do to make me give up my contacts."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P3322491240" "You idiots. I've been here for years gathering intel. You're all going to go down. Whether its the PPD or your own bosses, you're going down."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3260626034" "We caught the spy. What do you want us to do with the traitor?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P213114222" "This one is trained like a cop... took out two of our guys already. You'd better send us some backup."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P68674552" "We got the spy... wants to talk to Tub Ci. What do you want us to do?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P4250756825" "The spy's captured. I don't think this one's going to talk that easily, though. You should get the interrogation room ready."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P4197661423" "This is Syndicate business. You're making a mistake interfering!"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3715898520" "Looks like we may have a situation. We got someone eyeing us. We'll deal with it."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3940006948" "Hope we have some extra cells back at the club. We may have us two captives."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P296105171" "We found one of those Destroyer grunts trying to plant an explosive. Want us to take care of the problem?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1559976431" "Some Destroyer punk just took a swing at us. It feels like a setup to me. How do you want us to proceed?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2394630878" "We caught the guy seen running from the club. You want to talk to him, or are we going to handle it?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1926990630" "We found one of the Destroyers helping himself to some of our weapons. What do you want done?"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1066671772" "We may have to let this Destroyer punk go. It seems like someone else whats to mess with the Syndicate today!"

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2813145697" "We've detained a Resistance fighter looking to steal some stock. How should we proceed?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P615162304" "Some rebel was sneaking around in our stocks. No, captured. Bring 'em in?"
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2834449901" "Another Resistance crew tried to muscle in on our turf. We caught one of them. We'll an extraction team."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1590494375" "This one's not going to go without a fight. Send some additional muscle."

// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P130470742" "It looks like this rebel's brought some friends. Moving to capture."
// UNDERGROUND_SYNDICATE_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3927587408" "We've got ourselves a problem. Give us a minute to resolve it."




// UNDERGROUND_RESISTANCE_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2867510438" "We got the spy, but the thief wants to talk to Tub Ci. What do you want us to do?"

















































// UNDERGROUND_NT_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P785711641" "I shall defeat every last one of you!"
// UNDERGROUND_NT_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P635693627" "This is the battle I have waited for!"
// UNDERGROUND_NT_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P2569500526" "Victory will be mine!"



// UNDERGROUND_NT_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_ALERTED :
"P2664562024" "Looks like someone else wishes to join the fray!"
// UNDERGROUND_NT_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_ALERTED :
"P2215220382" "More combatants? I welcome the challenge!"
// UNDERGROUND_NT_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_ALERTED :
"P3167471461" "You're not getting away! Time for you all to die!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3269481850" "We will not tolerate your snooping around!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P957894250" "Prepare to face my wrath!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2618274702" "You should not be here! Now you're going to pay!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2902652791" "Your fate is now sealed!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3450842179" "I don't know. We have operations everywhere. Sooner or later, Cole's going to have to accept that he can't beat us."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1355317171" "Getting up and running in Nova Praetoria has proven more difficult that we thought. Those Destroyers have put the PPD on a high alert all the time."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2451937907" "Imperial City is really good for the Syndicate, but the real money gets made outside Praetoria. That's why Cole is never going to be able to stop us!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1137265046" "You should not be here!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2118177017" "You should know better than to interfere with the Syndicate!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2680353761" "They shall find pieces of you all over the city!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P971480441" "This shall be your final battle!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1145655048" "Your fate is sealed. You will die now!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1836752759" "We control all of the most powerful companies in Imperial City, but Cole just keeps trying to kick us out. We need to take him and his Praetors down, then this city will be ours!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2182993249" "Some of those Resistance fools got in our way a few days a go. Big mistake for them. We left none standing."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1346987628" "Those Destroyers are a real piece of work. It's all honor this, then rrraagh that. They have some real screws loose. Better fighters than the Resistance though."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P574185105" "If those PPD didn't have all this fancy tech, the city would be ours by now. We must ge our hands on some of what they've got. That'll end this quickly!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2112086763" "Eavesdropping on us? Big mistake!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3030462181" "I've been hoping someone would be stupid enough to get in my way! Time to die!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3938645575" "This is not your lucky day!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2379391942" "Your end has come!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2225419124" "What are we doing just waiting around? I want to get into the fight already!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2617941433" "I don't know why we play these games. We could really put the hurt on Cole just by shutting down all business in Imperial City."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3137796133" "The Underground is a pretty tough place. As if the near constant battles for control weren't enough, the Ghouls roam freely down there, throwing a wrench in everyone's plans."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3988535367" "Alright! Some action!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2894614025" "This is going to be fun!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3480313584" "I have some new moves I've been wanting to practice. Try not to die right away, OK?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1831226019" "I'm going to enjoy this!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1346226321" "This comes from the top. You must display discipline and precision in this operation. Succeed, and we seriously damage Cole's ability to operate in Imperial City. Fail, and none of you will live to regret it."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1330906625" "We will need to move swiftly. The shutdown will only last for three minutes. We can get the files and make ourselves a lot of money!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1920217253" "That's our target. Sure, he looks like some average citizen, but he knows where Cole's been stashing the stuff he steals from us. We get him and we can get some payback."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P609757217" "The plan's on hold. Take care of the intruder!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P3379536258" "You should not interfere in Syndicate business!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P957406489" "We were told to expect trouble. You are going to suffer!"



// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P2547980277" "We are coming in. You had better have the delivery or you shall face our wrath!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P2862065263" "You should not have stolen from us! This is your last chance!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P1096166325" "No more talking! This is our city and you will do as we say!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P370793178" "Quickly, take down the intruder!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P79599149" "Don't let anyone escape!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P1198103318" "You should not be here. Now you will face our wrath!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P2171866862" "Am I to understand that you are my escorts? I was unaware that I was perceived so poorly by Tub Ci."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P1881646084" "This is what passes for Syndicate these days? When I was your age, I was much more respectful!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P744692404" "You fools are aware that you will be the ones who suffer if I am late to the meeting?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P2235391311" "You do not know where you are going, do you?"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P2515040476" "Some escorts you have proven to be! I will deal with this personally!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P2503111637" "You should know better than to cross paths with the Syndicate!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P1677920069" "Eliminate this interloper or I will gut you all myself!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3080861020" "This is the intel, right?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1716350644" "How do I know this is the right info?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P124684976" "You've given us good info before, but what about this time?"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2509104691" "Quick, take 'em down before they can capture our helper!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2899113920" "Don't let this fool escape!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2218102133" "You've just found yourself in a really bad situation!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3015880809" "Look, I'm telling you this is good intel. The PPD are going to move on that club tonight."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P544030823" "I don't know what to say. They trust me. They have no idea this info comes to you. I just know it's what you need."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3203284456" "I don't know what you're going to do with this, and I don't want to know, but it's the info you wanted."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3077083559" "I didn't sign on for this. I'm out of here!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P503582668" "This is more than I bargained for! I'm out!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P689936055" "This has suddenly become too dangerous. I'm gone!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1895602819" "How much are you willing to pay for your freedom?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3731520620" "Look, we're taking you no matter what. The only question is how easy you make this on yourself."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P2069871627" "Perhaps if you'd not tried taking advantage of us, you'd not be in this situation!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P3730858941" "Looks like we've got another one!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P2805253842" "No one escapes. Capture them all."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P1195634360" "Hmmmm. We could probably get a lot of good information from this one. Take 'em alive!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P406467987" "Please just let me go! I'll get you the money, I promise!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P1509101895" "I... I don't want to die!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P2822661433" "I won't tell anyone what I saw, I promise! Just let me go!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P2214869912" "I don't want any trouble, please!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2873093679" "This is a good supplier. We've forged a good relationship with him, so I can promise this is top quality."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2221940452" "The Syndicate takes care of its own. That is why you are receiving such favorable terms."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3718562325" "Are you not interested in this offer? I will only make it once."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2133259797" "We'll finish this discussion later!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4159441446" "You've just made a big mistake!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1585039638" "It is time for you to meet an untimely end!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2945149466" "How do I know I'll get what is promised?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P761206750" "Are these goods legitimate, or are they the cheap stuff you sell everyone else?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P421843099" "I just want to make sure this is a fair deal."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4151803417" "I'm not going to get caught!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3012167090" "I'm not buying anything until this is dealt with!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3431096032" "Take this one out, then we'll talk terms!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE :
"P66200589" "We need to act quickly on this. The Praetors will only be in Imperial City for a few hours."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE :
"P3581324732" "I am certain that we will be rewarded very well when we succeed. But we'll have to get through the PPD first."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE :
"P730071457" "We'll use the Destroyers to make the diversion we need. They're so excitable, it'll be no problem."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE :
"P533758324" "The PPD have their hands full with the Resistance at the moment. They will not notice us if we use our skills."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_ALERTED :
"P2429564141" "Change of plans! Take down the spy!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_ALERTED :
"P2983044538" "Looks like we will need to adjust our plans slightly. Eliminate the threat!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_ALERTED :
"P1995153186" "We have a new plan. Defeat this intruder!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_INACTIVE :
"P819060198" "Do you know what we do to people who try to get involved in Syndicate business?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_INACTIVE :
"P1745602362" "If you are unwiling to pay, then we will just need to take the money from you!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_INACTIVE :
"P1318673868" "We have had enough of your delays. Pay us what is owed. or you shall face the consequences!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_ALERTED :
"P1512027583" "What do you think you are doing?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_ALERTED :
"P3612371197" "This interference will not stand!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_ALERTED :
"P2897754062" "You have crossed the wrong people, friend."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_ALERTED :
"P1813844706" "Your fate is now sealed. You will die!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE :
"P1749672776" "I swear, I'll find a way to make it up to you!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE :
"P3907805277" "No, no! Please! I'll take care of it!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE :
"P1198567759" "I'll get you whatever you want. Just don't hurt me!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_ALERTED :
"P2037460269" "I am out of here!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_ALERTED :
"P4037874035" "Oh, thank you! I thought they'd hurt me for sure!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_ALERTED :
"P4195274863" "I'm not staying around to see how this ends!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_ALERTED :
"P3707985802" "Thanks!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1776847323" "You Resistance keep getting in the way. It's time to put an end to it!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2235070872" "We have had enough of your pathetic Resistance. This is our city!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_RES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2794336700" "You are doomed to meet the same fate as all of the Resistance! Crushed beneath the boot of the Syndicate!"


// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_DES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P1457654449" "Do you Destroyers really think we'd just let you take the city? This is our city, and you're bad for business!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_DES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2572265857" "Nothing personal. This is just business."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_DES_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2775318233" "You Destroyers may be tough, but Fortune favors us. You will never win!"


// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_PPD_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P2036179335" "You cops keep interfering with the Syndicate's business. You have to go!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_PPD_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P564261514" "I have had enough of you, cop. It's time for you to meet your fate!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_BATTLE_PPD_NORULES_INACTIVE :
"P511690055" "You will not leave here alive, cop!"


// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P4011008343" "The Resistance? You're pathetic!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2166456006" "Are your weapons even loaded? You're all fools!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P1305043336" "What do you think is going to happen here? That you'll take me prisoner? Think again!"


// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_DES_INACTIVE :
"P3115054306" "You Destroyers think you're so tough. We're the ones who are going to take over!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_DES_INACTIVE :
"P1234184586" "You really think you stand a chance against us?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_DES_INACTIVE :
"P1243899009" "Cole is our enemy too. If you'd just get out of our way, we would deal with him!"


// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1218599013" "You PPD will never learn, will you? The Syndicate is in control here!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1662164266" "Let me go before I am forced to kill you all."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P2346549809" "You think you've won? Think again!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P2846330006" "None of you are going to walk away from this alive!"


// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3885886635" "We have one of the Clockwork. How do we disable it?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1666457239" "This Clockwork is very heavy. Please send additional support for transport."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P370750255" "This was easier than we thought. Now we just need to get it out of here."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3097532195" "We have to leave the machine a minute. We have a problem to deal with."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1504310704" "Hold on sending that team. We have to address a situation."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P888425465" "Someone's snooping around. Let us deal with it."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1250343754" "We cornered some cop trying to sneak into the facility. What should we do with him?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3275138278" "This is the cop who messed with us earlier. Want us to make him disappear?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3572994112" "We got the co. Want us to bring him to you so you can see what he was trying to do?"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P962248526" "Someone's getting in the middle of this. We need to deal with it."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1922707628" "We may have a problem. Send us a crew to help out."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREPPD_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P2951727805" "Fortune is smiling on us today. We may have ourselves another to ransom."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2648808130" "Really? You want us to bring this Resistance punk there? Are you sure?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1085982520" "This is just a Resistance fool. Even if we got any intel, it'd just be gibberish."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2310173348" "Wait, wait. Why can't we just off this fool here?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P23868944" "Yes, a Resistance fighter. Really? Scott's paying that much is he? Bringing this one in then!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1883014283" "We have a problem."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P2571262776" "Looks like someone's trying to interfere. Let us handle it."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURERES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3255986531" "We have another to subdue. I'll contact you when we are done."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2084991162" "I don't know if its worth holding these Destroyers. They're pretty tough to keep under control."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1160543447" "Do you really want to risk this one going berserk and messing up the office? Tub Ci would be... displeased."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1489159983" "Are you sure its worth the trouble to bring this one in?"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3748624681" "Forget this. We're just taking everyone down."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3921347979" "I don't have time for this. We have ourselves a hero getting in the middle of this."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTUREDES_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P2733518292" "We have a slight problem. We'll take care of it then get back to you."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P1024927626" "Looks like you haven't caught me after all!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P1827559994" "I'm out of here!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_SPY_ACTIVE :
"P2269473299" "This was your best chance to catch me, and you've blown it!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3841161938" "We have the spy. Should we deal with it here or at the shop?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P3153742789" "Tub Ci wants to see this one? Where shall we deliver the spy, then?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1179283627" "I don't know how much information is missing. You'll need to ask the spy."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1896440169" "No one leaves here alive!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3311840081" "Take them all down!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_CAPTURESYN_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P1701997706" "Kill the spy and this fool!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ACTIVE :
"P403315581" "You are foolish to think we'd let you walk freely in our turf!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ACTIVE :
"P2686266354" "You Resistance fools stole this turf from us. It's time you paid us back!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ACTIVE :
"P4168885390" "Get them all! They're worth a lot to that fool Scott!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ALERT :
"P141095500" "Take this one down too!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ALERT :
"P3794278470" "Fate has not smiled on you today. Now you die!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ALERT :
"P545000367" "I was hoping for a real challenge!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_DES_ACTIVE :
"P1951267068" "We've had enough of you getting in our way!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_DES_ACTIVE :
"P2653284222" "It's payback time!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_DES_ALERT :
"P2083360816" "Now this is a fight!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ACTIVE :
"P2364799252" "Quick! Take them down!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ACTIVE :
"P3463250014" "Eliminate them!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ACTIVE :
"P3231982936" "Strike now!"


// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ACTIVE :
"P483278328" "Quick! Let's show these grunts the Syndicate means business!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ACTIVE :
"P1291136698" "You Resistance shouldn't be here!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ACTIVE :
"P4217472221" "End of the road for you!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ALERT :
"P1637484789" "As if these grunts weren't bad enough!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ALERT :
"P3211713459" "Looks like we got ourselves a real challenge!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_RES_ALERT :
"P726928544" "Time for a real fight!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ACTIVE :
"P1846118704" "Here we come, cops! Hope you're ready to die!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ACTIVE :
"P3852172824" "You cops made a big mistake coming here!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ACTIVE :
"P3455417430" "This is the end for you, cop!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ALERT :
"P3050522880" "Looks like someone else wants to play!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ALERT :
"P2737088826" "You shouldn't have gotten involved!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_AMBUSHING_PPD_ALERT :
"P3871584623" "End of the road for you. Everyone dies!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1128705180" "As a member of the Syndicate, you are expected to serve our interests only. Disregard this expectation at your peril."
// NEUTROPOLIS_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2846970750" "This is but the beginning of your career. Serve us well and fortune will smile upon you."
// NEUTROPOLIS_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P6357218" "Do not forget the oath you have sworn to us this day. It is an oath that extends beyond life!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2048241709" "And now, it is time for your first trial!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1935026381" "Initiate, we will deal with this threat together!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_INITIATION_SCROLLREADER_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1817155603" "Try not to make your first day your last, initiate. Destroy this fool!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P199844280" "Be ready. Those cops could try to make a move anytime."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2383364609" "If I give the word, do not hesitate. We must eliminate all threats."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SNIPERS_BINOCS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P902010478" "Do not let your guard down. We could face a foe at any moment."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P686114183" "You're going to regret challenging us!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2605061542" "No one messes with the Syndicate and lives!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SNIPERS_BINOCS_ACTIVE_TEXT :
"P181751297" "You should not have come here. Now you will die!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1153595198" "This is the final mistake you will ever make!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3783642598" "You should not have come here!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3799153021" "You will learn not to cross the Syndicate!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1457333778" "This is the end of the road for you!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3932267827" "Neutropolis is a mess. Sure, Neuron's Reach is still nice, but have you seen Lambda? Imperial City is much better."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3159526974" "The Ghouls aren't even the worst part about this place. Those Resistance idiots hold a lot of turf over in Lambda. Everyone there speaks gibberish. It's maddening!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2590233491" "The Ghouls... I get them. They're hungry and they want to eat you. The Resistance still confuse me. But I think that's just because they make no sense to me."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3432253635" "Looks like we have a fight on our hands."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_COFFEEBREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1397870137" "You are unwise to challenge the Syndicate!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P933617230" "Neutropolis is not a place I want to spend a lot of time in. Those Ghouls can show up anywhere and try to bite your arm off."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P742199914" "We have to keep our hold in Neutropolis. If we lose the shipping lanes, what's going to stop Cole from taking us out?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1008433601" "If we could get Neuron and his tower, we could own this city. Think of it... all Cole's technology in our hands!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3205379863" "Looks like someone wants to play!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3140181109" "You're dead!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1614659661" "This is the last fight you're ever going to have!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3321841886" "Neutropolis has the technology and the power. Nova and Imperial are nice, but if you own this place, you own Praetoria."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P830101426" "We have to take over this section of the city. Neutropolis is where the real power of Cole's little empire comes from."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3595475383" "If it weren't for the Destroyers, we could be making a stronger push to take over Neutropolis. They've kept us from bringing our full might down on this place."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3861547784" "Your fate is to die by my hand!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3671238729" "Your time has run its course."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P26934977" "I will kill you!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P4006745931" "Those wretched Ghouls are threatening our control of the shipping lanes. We have to find their lair and wipe 'em out."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P3683185882" "The Destroyers and the cops are keeping the pressure up in Imperial, so we have to make sure nothing goes wrong in Neutropolis."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P3747742001" "Forget the Resistance. They're the least of our problems at the moment. Neuron and his Clockwork are pushing us hard."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P3169692936" "Time for you to die!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_GETORDERS_READORDERS_ACTIVE :
"P4108819017" "I've been itching for a fight all day!"



// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P296266827" "You are only making this harder on yourself. Open this door and Tub Ci may let you live!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P2018208522" "Enough of this! We're coming for you and there's nothing you can do about it!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P3941462277" "This is your last chance. Come out now or we'll just kill everyone."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P1637771010" "Don't let this one get away!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P1603625763" "You're going to regret getting involved!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P2082134392" "Your luck has run out. Time to die!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_ALERTED :
"P1363220312" "Fortune does not smile on you!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P2870996246" "If I am late in making this delivery, it will be you who suffers!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P1500258742" "I was to have been at the meeting ten minutes ago. This does not bode well for your futures!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_INACTIVE :
"P98232929" "What is taking so long? You should know how to get there!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P1112640291" "You fools have brought this upon us. Now I will deal with the mess!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P2209509195" "When this fight is over, I will deal with each of you personally!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_BOSS_CONSTERNATION_ALERTED :
"P2746903628" "I shall deal with this intruder and then with all of you!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2272685098" "Look, we need to make a move. We need more intel."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4090201767" "Always excuses. We pay you well, don't we?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1569873180" "This isn't enough. I'm beginning to rethink this bargain we've struck."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3354070792" "Looks like you're in the wrong place at the wrong time!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P877589882" "This won't hurt for very long!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_SYN_SPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1242803715" "Fortune does not smile upon you today!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1784181329" "In Neutropolis, you've got to deal with Neuron and Anti-Matter more than Cole. Believe me, that's not a lot easier. I got all the info I could."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3583746616" "This is all the information I could get my hands on. Neuron's got that tower sealed tight."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2734623555" "The Reactors are really well defended, so these are the best shots I could get."

// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2353641603" "You don't pay me enough to deal with this. I'm out of here."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3033615764" "This is too much heat for me. I'm getting out now!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P794727101" "This is way more than I bargained for! I'm gone!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P739968731" "You are coming with us! There is nothing you can do about it!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1620770766" "You can come peacefully or painfully. Choose wisely!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3315990236" "There is no choice and no escape. You are coming wuth us now."



// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1120745938" "This is what we agreed to. If you don't have the money, that's your problem."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P18756721" "Look, I'm already giving this to you at my cost. You want I should give it to you for free?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3183514552" "What's the problem? This is the deal we agreed to."


// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3800133161" "I know. But I want a better deal."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4126188192" "I don't care. You're going to give it to me anyway, or I'll just have to bring this up with Tub Ci."
// NEUTROPOLIS_ALLHOODS_SYN_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P883875550" "I'm changing the deal. You don't like it? Tough."


// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE :
"P1859103500" "We need to hit Neuron where it hurts. That's his precious tower. He wants to avoid a fight. Let's bring it to him."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE :
"P3101347091" "Word is Cole's men at Lambda are going to move against the Resistance tonight. We can use this as a chance to get in there and steal some new weapons."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_INACTIVE :
"P1252511603" "The Ghouls have the PPD distracted. We shouldn't have any trouble getting in."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_ALERTED :
"P735197293" "Plans have changed. First, we execute this fool!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_ALERTED :
"P202809351" "Looks like a new opportunity has presented itself!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HATCHPLOT_PLOTTER_ALERTED :
"P26537596" "Let's just kidnap this fool!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_INACTIVE :
"P2581087925" "Tell me what I want to know or this will not end well for you."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_INACTIVE :
"P3388279093" "Did you really think you could try to steal from us? Pay us!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_THREATENING_INACTIVE :
"P2829786759" "We have had enough of your stalling. Give us the money you owe us or there's no telling what might happen to you... your family..."


// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE :
"P867064249" "Please! Don't hurt anyone. I'll get you what you need!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE :
"P2508485068" "I don't want an trouble! Please!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_INACTIVE :
"P4128414149" "I don't know what you're talking about! Just let me go!"

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_ALERTED :
"P844402503" "I'm getting out of here!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_ALERTED :
"P2082857970" "Please! Get them away from me!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_HARASSCIT_CITIZENCHATTING_ALERTED :
"P3172762641" "I'm getting as far away as I can!"













// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P1928924983" "We have captured one of Cole's Clockwork. Want us to dismantle it here or is this one getting auctioned off?"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P2421486353" "This one's in good condition last time. Should fetch a good price!"
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE :
"P397396157" "Let's get this thing out of here right away. Last time, one went berserk and killed three of our guys."

// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
"P3901327153" "We're leaving the machine. There's been a complication."
// NEUTROPOLIS_SYN_CAPTURECWK_WALKIETALKIE_ACTIVE :
